st commonly affects the-", "option1": "Posterior lobe ", "option2": "Anterior lobe ", "option3": "Median lobe ", "option4": "Lateral lobe ", "answer": "3", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Prostate_MHS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"582\" />"}, {"id": "38", "question": "৩৮) Which is not a true ligament of the uterus? ", "option1": "Broad ligament ", "option2": "Round ligament ", "option3": "Pubocervical ligament ", "option4": "Transverse cervical ligament ", "answer": "1", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Ligaments_of_uterus_.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"528\" />"}, {"id": "39", "question": "৩৯) Which is a content of the superficial perineal pouch in male? ", "option1": "Membranous urethra ", "option2": "Root of the penis ", "option3": "Bartholin glands ", "option4": "Bulbourethral glands ", "answer": "2", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/superficial_perineal_pouch_contents.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"434\" /><br /><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/deep_perineal_pouch.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1286\" height=\"1010\" />"}, {"id": "40", "question": "৪০) The perineal body is not formed by-", "option1": "External anal sphincter ", "option2": "Levator ani ", "option3": "Superficial transversus perinei", "option4": "Obturator internus ", "answer": "4", "exp": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/Perineal_Body_.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1577\" height=\"1021\" />"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 6063, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "1800000", "is_omr": false, "omr_time": "7200000"